      <p style='font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 20px;'>I am an Electrical and Electronics Engineer based in Dhaka, holding a B.Sc. from Southeast University. My background is uniquely positioned at the intersection of electrical infrastructure and modern programming logic.</p>
