      <h3>Electric Rickshaws in Dhaka: Survey &amp; Improvement Modeling</h3>
      <p style='font-weight: 500; color: var(--dark); margin-bottom: 15px;'><i class='fa-solid fa-user-tie' style='color: var(--primary); margin-right: 8px;'/> Role: Lead Researcher &amp; Author</p>
      
